### Variables ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@host = http://localhost:8000
@contentType = application/json

# After running "Create employee", copy the returned `id` into this variable
# (or use the `@employeeId` capture below if your client supports it).
@employeeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# After running "Create department" / "Create project", copy the returned `id`s here.
@departmentId = 05ac0959-4df0-4697-9b0e-f42cdfafa4a4
@projectId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### CREATE
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create — minimal valid payload
# @name createEmployee
POST {{host}}/employees
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "position": "Senior Engineer",
  "departmentId": "{{departmentId}}",
  "notes": "Initial hire",
  "isActive": true
}

### Create — second employee (for pagination/sorting tests)
POST {{host}}/employees
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "John2",
  "lastName": "Smith2",
  "email": "john.smith2@example.com",
  "position": "Manager",
  "departmentId": "{{departmentId}}"
}

### Create — third employee
POST {{host}}/employees
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Brown",
  "email": "alice.brown@example.com",
  "position": "Designer",
  "isActive": false
}

### Create — duplicate email (expects 409 Conflict)
POST {{host}}/employees
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "position": "Senior Engineer"
}

### Create — invalid payload (expects 400 Bad Request, zod issues)
POST {{host}}/employees
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "",
  "email": "not-an-email"
}


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### LIST — pagination, sorting, filtering
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List — defaults (page=1, pageSize=20, sort by createdAt desc)
GET {{host}}/employees

### List — pagination
GET {{host}}/employees?page=2&pageSize=5

### List — sort by lastName ascending
GET {{host}}/employees?sortBy=lastName&sortOrder=desc

### List — sort by email descending
GET {{host}}/employees?sortBy=email&sortOrder=desc

### List — search across firstName / lastName / email (case-insensitive)
GET {{host}}/employees?search=jane

### List — filter by department (uuid)
GET {{host}}/employees?departmentId={{departmentId}}

### List — filter by position
GET {{host}}/employees?position=Senior Engineer

### List — filter active only
GET {{host}}/employees?isActive=true

### List — combined filters + pagination + sort
GET {{host}}/employees?search=e&departmentId={{departmentId}}&isActive=true&sortBy=firstName&sortOrder=asc&page=1&pageSize=10

### List — eager-load relationships (1:1 profile, 1:N department, N:N projects)
GET {{host}}/employees?include=department,profile,projects&pageSize=5

### List — invalid sortBy (expects 400)
GET {{host}}/employees?sortBy=password

### List — pageSize over the cap (expects 400)
GET {{host}}/employees?pageSize=500


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### READ ONE
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Find one — by id
GET {{host}}/employees/a3323cfc-1598-4757-9273-9f6322f0ffa3

### Find one — invalid uuid (expects 400)
GET {{host}}/employees/not-a-uuid

### Find one — non-existent uuid (expects 404)
GET {{host}}/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### UPDATE
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Update — partial fields
PATCH {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "position": "Staff Engineer",
  "notes": "Promoted on 2026-05-01"
}

### Update — toggle isActive
PATCH {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Update — empty body (no-op, returns current row)
PATCH {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### Update — unknown field (expects 400 because schema is .strict())
PATCH {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "salary": 100000
}


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### DELETE
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Remove — by id (expects 204 No Content)
DELETE {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}

### Remove — non-existent uuid (expects 404)
DELETE {{host}}/employees/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### EMPLOYEE — find one with includes (1:1, 1:N, N:N)
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Find one — embed department (1:N parent)
GET {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}?include=department

### Find one — embed profile (1:1 child)
GET {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}?include=profile

### Find one — embed projects (N:N via junction)
GET {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}?include=projects

### Find one — embed everything
GET {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}?include=department,profile,projects


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### EMPLOYEE PROFILE — 1:1 (employees ↔ employee_profiles)
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get profile for an employee (404 if none yet)
GET {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}/profile

### Upsert profile (PUT — create or replace)
PUT {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bio": "Backend engineer focused on distributed systems.",
  "phone": "+1-555-0100",
  "address": "1 Infinite Loop, Cupertino, CA",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-04-12"
}

### Upsert profile — update only some fields
PUT {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bio": "Updated bio",
  "phone": "+1-555-0199"
}


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### DEPARTMENTS — CRUD (1:N parent)
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create department
# @name createDepartment
POST {{host}}/departments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Engineering",
  "description": "Builds and runs the platform"
}

### Create — duplicate name (expects 409)
POST {{host}}/departments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Engineering"
}

### List departments
GET {{host}}/departments

### List — search + sort
GET {{host}}/departments?search=eng&sortBy=name&sortOrder=asc

### List — embed employees on each department (1:N)
GET {{host}}/departments?includeEmployees=true&pageSize=5

### Find one
GET {{host}}/departments/{{departmentId}}

### Find one — embed employees
GET {{host}}/departments/{{departmentId}}?includeEmployees=true

### Update
PATCH {{host}}/departments/{{departmentId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "description": "Builds and operates the platform end-to-end"
}

### Delete (employees keep existing rows; their departmentId becomes NULL)
DELETE {{host}}/departments/{{departmentId}}


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### PROJECTS — CRUD
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create project
# @name createProject
POST {{host}}/projects
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Atlas Platform v2",
  "description": "Next-gen platform rewrite",
  "startDate": "2026-01-15",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31",
  "isActive": true
}

### Create — invalid date order (expects 400)
POST {{host}}/projects
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Bad Dates",
  "startDate": "2026-12-31",
  "endDate": "2026-01-15"
}

### List projects
GET {{host}}/projects

### List — only active, with members embedded
GET {{host}}/projects?isActive=true&includeMembers=true

### Find one
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}

### Find one — embed members (each with their employee)
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}?includeMembers=true

### Update
PATCH {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Delete (cascades all assignments in employee_projects)
DELETE {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### PROJECT MEMBERS — N:N (employees ↔ projects via employee_projects)
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List members of a project
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members

### List projects an employee is on (from the employee side)
GET {{host}}/employees/{{employeeId}}/projects

### Assign an employee to a project
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}",
  "role": "Tech Lead",
  "allocation": 80
}

### Assign — duplicate (expects 409, composite PK)
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}",
  "role": "Tech Lead",
  "allocation": 80
}

### Update assignment metadata (role / allocation)
PATCH {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "role": "Engineer",
  "allocation": 50
}

### Remove member (expects 204)
DELETE {{host}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members/{{employeeId}}
